## Trees {.unnumbered}

::: {#fig-gal-tree}

::: {#3c0d9463 .cell renderings='["light","dark"]' execution_count=4}
``` {.python .cell-code code-fold="true" code-summary="Code"}
def draw(ax, p):
    N = V.Node
    root = N("f(4)", [N("f(3)", [N("f(2)"), N("f(1)", color="green")]), N("f(2)", color="pink", note="repeat")])
    V.tree(ax, p, root)
V.show(draw)
```

